WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
Jamie jumps toward Chun-Li’s standing heavy-kick range.

2
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.400
Standing heavy kick intercepts Jamie in the air.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:01.750
Chun-Li enters Serenity Stream and waits for the juggle height.

4
00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.700
The stance medium kick connects on the falling opponent.

5
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.500
Heavy Tensho Kicks continues the juggle.

6
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Both characters recover after the anti-air conversion.
